 ("p", "A **system of coordinates** uses two values to fix a position exactly. In a market you can say 'the 7th shop in the 5th row'. On a chessboard a move is noted with a letter and a number, for example d2 to d4 (the queen's pawn moves two squares). Maps use the same idea to locate any place on the Earth."),
